					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I think what did it for me was the pun title. Like, that was enough to get the idea across. Using it <em>again</em> the way you did sunk the connection before I even got to the crosslink. It's a very subtle and genius move, which is a weird thing to say, given&#8230; you know.</p> <p>MC&amp;D outsourcing to dado is also just a fun image. I'd say that this was a known mistake, given that it isn't the first time they've heard of dado (he gets a mention in <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/hypnotraline">Hypnotraline</a>), but I'm willing to forfeit that this is a different universe for obvious reasons.</p> <p>Upvoted.</p> 
				 	]]>
